#. module: pms_downpayment_lifecycle
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_downpayment_lifecycle.field_pms_folio__downpayment_cancel_state
msgid ""
"Set on a cancelled folio that still had a down payment invoice standing."
msgstr "Se marca en el folio cancelado que todavía tenía una factura de anticipo en pie."

#. module: pms_downpayment_lifecycle
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_downpayment_lifecycle.field_account_bank_statement_line__downpayment_transfer_state
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_downpayment_lifecycle.field_account_move__downpayment_transfer_state
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_downpayment_lifecycle.field_account_payment__downpayment_transfer_state
msgid ""
"Set on a final invoice that absorbed a down payment issued to a different "
"customer. The transfer itself runs in its own job, so that a down payment "
"that will not settle can never stop the stay from being invoiced."
msgstr "Se marca en la factura final que absorbe un anticipo emitido a otro cliente. El traspaso se ejecuta en su propio job, para que un anticipo que no se vaya a resolver nunca impida facturar la estancia."

#. module: pms_downpayment_lifecycle
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_downpayment_lifecycle.field_account_payment__downpayment_refund_state
msgid ""
"Set on a refund that gives back money collected as a down payment: it "
"rectifies the down payment invoice itself instead of producing an unrelated "
"credit note."
msgstr "Se marca en la devolución que reintegra dinero cobrado como anticipo: rectifica la propia factura de anticipo en lugar de generar una rectificativa sin relación."

#. module: pms_downpayment_lifecycle
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_downpayment_lifecycle.field_account_payment__downpayment_reissue_partner_id
msgid ""
"Set while a payment sits in draft with its down payment already rectified: "
"the customer the replacement must be issued to once the new amount is known."
msgstr "Se marca mientras el cobro está en borrador con su anticipo ya rectificado: el cliente al que hay que reemitirlo en cuanto se conozca el nuevo importe."

#. module: pms_downpayment_lifecycle
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_downpayment_lifecycle/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The folio still has %s line(s) left to invoice, so it cannot be told whether"
" the down payment belongs to this invoice or to the next one."
msgstr "Al folio le quedan %s línea(s) por facturar, así que no se puede saber si el anticipo corresponde a esta factura o a la siguiente."

#. module: pms_downpayment_lifecycle
